{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは、渡辺です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2016/03/19/5104251/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この間未央奈と焼肉を食べに\n行ってきました〜♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"未央奈とは本当に久しぶりに\nゆっくりお話とかふざけたりとか\n出来たからすごく嬉しかった(^ ^)\n未央奈がたくさん頼むから\nもう〜頼みすぎ〜とか言いつつ\n足りないね〜とか言いながら\n2人でパクパク食べちゃいました、、笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"反省中(/ _ ; )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、帝一の國観に行って来ました！\nゲネだったのでにゃんでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"にゃんとは演技についていろいろな\nお話をした事があったので\n思い出しながら、いろいろな視点で\n見る事ができて本当に面白くて\n楽しかったです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなちまさんの演技も見たい(>_<)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私もお芝居したいなあ\nって思う気持ちが強くなりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私も頑張らなきゃ(^ ^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2016/03/19/5104251/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎質問返し◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・京都、名古屋でコスプレするのかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→します！今何を着るか考え中"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・朝、昼、晩どこが一番食べれる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→昼と晩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・男の人が髪の毛を染めるとしたら何色がいいですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→チョコレート色！薄い茶色みたいな！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・みり愛ちゃんが、一度はやってみたい職業は？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→幼稚園の先生"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・みり愛の大切な物はなんですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→私が生まれた時にパパが\n記念に買って来た生まれた\n時の大きさと同じぬいぐるみです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとは家族や友達、\nそして、私を今支えてくれている\nファンの皆様、\nだから今笑えています"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生誕祭のアルバムも大切です\nずっとずっと宝物です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回の逆質問は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分にとって大切なものは？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメントを読んで多い順に\n紹介します"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"１位 乃木坂"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"２位 家族"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3位 友達"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"４位 みり愛"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"５位 人との繋がり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんと！\n４位に私が入っていてありがたき幸せ‼︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回の逆質問は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今までで1番ドキドキしたことは？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"にします！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメントお待ちしております♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2016/03/19/5104251/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日、明日はいよいよ\nらりんさんの卒業コンサート。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"らりんさんの背中を\nしっかり見て目に焼き付けます\n正直卒業なんてしてほしくなくて\n寂しくていろいろと考えちゃう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも笑顔で送りたいです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来る方は宜しくお願いします♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また見てね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みり愛"}],"source":"archive"}